<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">EN_CLT cua_Tiếng⋅Co_ltr Thu Feb 13 2025 16:49:00 GMT+0700 (Indochina Time) tc</book>
  <para style="usfm">3.0</para>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">James</para>
  <para style="toc1">Thư Ja-kơ</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ja-kơ</para>
  <para style="toc3">Jas</para>
  <para style="mt">Ja-kơ</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Ja-kơ, xapok ku Kơy Plêêk ji ku Lôôk wơơt Dêh Jê-xu, atăq ka kưl vaarq adrơơk đom dong varơuq pachaay hyaak: Xăk hlơq oh ay đom xuum hlah hlaak. <verse eid="JAS 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Wơơy oh ay ku gô, tuôôy oh ay klêh muut đu thưq thưh thek, dayh 'yo nưq laa xuum hlah xaleep, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />vii xet đaneq varơuq thưh xuum tuôq oh ay seng vlôh paraat chiuq uunq. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Bơh, paraat chiuq uunq pheq padoh vlôh đu tol kông paraat, xôq oh ay e hnoq jah kôt tok ji payôôch, leh măn thiuq kajoq. <verse eid="JAS 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Măn atoh kơyq nưq đom oh ay thiuq khôôt xet, adro nưq dayh apôôy vôôch varơuq nưq xing Kơy Plêêk, Kơy kahniq pôôt kach ranưh ranơơy ka tôôy adro đơu leh toah trek, yôôych varơuq khôôt xet hnoq jah kahniq ăm adro nưq. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Bơh adro nưq pheq apôôy vôôch đom xuum tuôq, leh biit ravơq kajoq, vii adro biit ravơq dang đaji rangaq tahli, biq kapuh hooy ji ranhuq ranhek adroyq khiel. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Adro đanưq te biit đaneq ni hnoq nhonq jah kajoq xing Lôôk, <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />nưq laa adro ragơy tađôôy xuum, leh kajưk đom tôôy trôôk hooy ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Adro oh ay đom aduq adrah dayh pa ưưt truh ka aduq yơơt dik ku xăk, <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />măn adro karoh dayh pa ưưt truh varơuq adrah ku xăk, vii adro nưq hnoq dalơh hooy đaji raak gôk pi gôk manay rek. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Mot hngơy vlok tok dii rahưk tôq huur vuh ji dơơp kateh ha'yauq rek gay, raak ni rôh ruh, kaveeh tamaq kaxay ku ni ruh hlơơp. Dang anưq, manih karoh kung hnoq biq kateh ha'yauq katul đom kaluh varơuq ku xăk. <verse eid="JAS 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Vanong ka adro chiuq thưh thek. Vii, tuôôy heq jah xanưk anưq, adro nưq hnoq nhonq đoat varơuq riirh, laa varơuq đơu Kơy Plêêk heq tavek kahniq ka khơl leq xung xiaq Kadraq. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Tuôôy biq adô aluut, te e kơyq đnooy đaneq: “Gô biq Kơy Plêêk adô aluut!”, vii Kơy Plêêk laa leh ik biq varơuq xơk adô aluut, đơu kadih Kadraq kung be adô aluut kơyq. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Bơh tôôy adro biq adô aluut, tuôôy biq duuy aluut ji aluut patuut bơyh xuum hmưch trôôch ku kadih ni. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Xatyauq nưq, atêq tuôôy heq măn bonq, xuum hmưch trôôch seng vlôh kadrôôp maroh, đơu atêq tuôôy heq jah văch yuôôr, kadrôôp maroh seng vlôh varơuq kaxêêt. <verse eid="JAS 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />Wơơy oh ay xung xiaq ku gô, te xôq ni biq aluut pa ôôh. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Tôôy varơuq kahniq ăm tơơl kaxay ji tôôy kadrool xaleep raay dơơp vlôh xing ataalh, laa truh xing Vaq ku varơuq tađnah, đơu đom Kadraq leh e varơuq xaloah dơyh long galơuq pahlơơp tađôôy. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Tyauq đaji heq đinq, Kadraq heq pahleh haay vlôh bơơn apok ku hyioh jăk, xôq haay laa muuyq loayq play adroyq dik đom kaluh dong paroh ku Kadraq. <verse eid="JAS 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Wơơy oh ay xung xiaq ku gô, dayh xet đaneq: Tôôy adro pheq dayh tameng, manưưn đnooy, manưưn jaraq. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Vii đơơt jaraq ku koot manih leh dơơp yuôôr varơuq hyioh jăk ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Vii anưq, atêq tuôôy heq leh ka'lăk kaluh thưq klơl 'yêq kung xet taleq varơuq xơuq xơk, dayh nhonq xok đom varơuq atuq xuum apok jah paraay pêêt, laa apok e hnoq wơơt xok phool hiel oh ay. <verse eid="JAS 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Dayh vlôh jêêk khơl adro dơơp tyauq apok, te vơ laa khơl adro tameng đơu patuut pa ôôh kadih xăk. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Vii atoh adro leq laa dro tameng apok đơu leh aalq laa dro dơơp tyauq, yôôych adro nưq dang đaji muuyq dro 'yo atrêêk mamưưt kadih 'miêh ku ni đom ramil. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Adro nưq heq atrêêk xăk yôôch ka'lăk hooy, yôôych vơ tawol hlơơp xăk 'miêh đaji đa leq. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Bơh kơyq tabông muut ganuun xaleep ku varơuq rayơh rayơơy, ji kưq wêêt kajưk dơơp anưq, leh vlôh jêêk adro tameng ragơy tawol, đơu laa adro dơơp varơuq duh dưk dơơp, yôôych dro nưq hnoq jah vanong đom varơuq dơơp ku xăk. <verse eid="JAS 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Atoh kơyq biit xăk laa khôôt đaauq đơu leh jư ik kapiet xăk, bơh kưq aluut pa ôôh xuum xăk, yôôych đaauq ku adro nưq be jaq triq kajoq. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Đaauq pa xarêh ji leh hlêêl a'moh adroyq kangưưr Kơy Plêêk, Vaq haay, nưq laa waak rơy oh de leh e miq vaq, mo valơu đom đơơt pơơl dal ku oot, ji jư xăk leh klơl 'yêq bơyh dêh araak.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Wơơy oh ay ku gô, te jư xuum tuôq aduq Lôôk haay, laa Lôôk Wơơt Dêh Jê-xu tađnah tađnaak, dii varơuq bing. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Vii atoh anưq muuyq dro hlưk kook de vajang dii qwuân aau kaxay tamaq muut đom hnhư tagumq ku oh ay, đơu muuyq adro adrah dii qwuân aau 'moh 'mơy kung muut đnoyq, <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />bơh oh ay tabông muut manih hlưp qwuân aau kaxay tamaq ji đnooy: “Xiin kơy 'ngôôy aduq tol taak neq!”, ji đôôyq dii manih adrah, oh ay đnooy: “Ay dưk vlôh hơq!”, long “dayh 'ngôôy gah đnool jôôk gô!”, <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />yôôych be aalq oh ay heq aklah đêh xa dơơp katul đom kadih xăk oh ay ji vlôh jêêk adro xưh xadrah dii kaluh kadih biit xơk xơuq aleq? <verse eid="JAS 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Wơơy oh ay xung xiaq ku gô, dayh tameng: Be aalq Kơy Plêêk heq rơơlh manih adrah pơơl đom dêh araak xôq vlôh jêêk manih karoh e đom xuum tuôq ji manih nhonq jah daak plêêk đơu Kadraq heq tavek dii khơl leq xung xiaq Kadraq aleq? <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Anưq đơu oh ay heq dơơp ra ơơh khơl adrah! Be aalq adro karoh ragơy rôp toop oh ay ji oot ragơy hwa oh ay vlôh xadrah aleq? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Be aalq oot ragơy tơơk galơh yal kaxay xaleep heq jah xôq ataalh oh ay aleq? <verse eid="JAS 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Lunư, atoh oh ay dơơp xaleep ganuun ku Vuua tyauq đaji Rahlăp Vah: “Dayh xung xiaq manih gah gih xăk đaji kadih xăk xamơk ni”, yôôych oh ay dơơp varơuq troq. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Bơh atoh oh ay bing, yôôych oh ay lôp kadrôôp, ji biq ganuun xưh xadrah đaji khơl lôp ganuun. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Vii adro leq e hnoq tameng jư dêq hloay ganuun, bơh xatôôlh gưlh măn muuyq varơuq, yôôych adro nưq vlôh jêêk adro lôp kadrôôp dêq hloay. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Vii Kơy heq xanoh: “Te tuut taak!” kung heq xanoh: “Te păk kaxêêt manih!”. Bơh atoh oh ay leh tuut taak, đơu laay păk kaxêêt manih, yôôych oh ay vlôh jêêk dro lôp kadrôôp ganuun. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Lunưq dayh đnooy athêêk ji dưk dơơp đaji khơl adro hnoq biq xưh xadrah bơyh ganuun ku varơuq rayơh rayơơy. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Vii varơuq xưh xadrah leh biit angơuq adro leh kahnoq xuum biit angơuq. Xuum biit angơuq katơơk galơh iaq varơuq xưh xadrah!<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Wơơy oh ay ku gô, e ik lơơy kajoq atoh kơyq nưq đnooy ni e xuum tuôq bơh laay leh e varơuq dơơp? Xuum tuôq nưq be hnoq wơơt adro nưq, jơq be? <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Atoh muuyq oh ay long ay oh vơ e xăk vok hloh ji thiuq tuôông xa tôôy hngơy, <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />bơh muuyq dro đom oh ay đnooy dii oot: “Dayh hooy đom hrok hrol, pheq jư ka xatôq ji xa dong phiq!”, đơu oh ay be ăm oot kaluh tuôông xăk xamơk duh xa, yôôych e it lơơy kajoq? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Xuum tuôq kung đanưq, atoh leh e varơuq dơơp yôôych kadih ni kaxêêt. <verse eid="JAS 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Lunư, kơyq nưq hnoq đnooy: “Ay e xuum tuôq, măn gô e varơuq dơơp.” Dayh ăm gô hloq xuum tuôq leh e varơuq dơơp ku ay, yôôch gô hnoq ăm ay hloq xuum tuôq bơơn varơuq dơơp ku gô. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />Ay tuôq đaneq Kơy Plêêk laa muuyq heq. Ay tuôq jơq. Kamuuych kung tuôq ji ni padrau yôq. <verse eid="JAS 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Nee adro vlô khưrq, ay xung xet đaneq xuum tuôq be e varơuq dơơp laa lưp xung leh? <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Be aalq Ap-ra-ham, mo kơy haay, heq jah xưng hyioh jăk bơơn varơuq dơơp tuôôy kơy tơơk tưp I-sak, koot kanau kơy, ataalh para hơu aleq? <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />Ay hloq đaneq xuum tuôq xatyauq hloay dii varơuq dơơp ku kơy, ji gamưh varơuq dơơp, xuum tuôq heq jah payôôch. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Apok Rahlăp Vah neq heq jah jêêk, đaneq: “Ap-ra-ham tuôq Kơy Plêêk, varơuq nưq jah taboon laa hyioh jăk ka kơy”, ji kơy jah taayh laa 'wơyq ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Oh ay hloq nưq, muuyq dro jah xưng hyioh jăk bơơn varơuq dơơp, ji leh vơ bơyh xuum tuôq đơu heq. <verse eid="JAS 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Kung dang kadih đanưq, be aalq mư xakwoah Ra-hap heq jah xưng hyioh jăk bơơn varơuq dơơp tuôôy takôô jarooy khơl jah patăk ji jarooy oot hooy bơơn trôôk đêh aleq? <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Vii đaji xaak leh e phool yôôych kaxêêt đaleq, xuum tuôq leh e varơuq dơơp yôôych kung kaxêêt đanưq.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Wơơy oh ay ku gô, te e 'ngưng adro đom oh ay dơơp thơy, bơyh xet đaneq haay hnoq pheq nhonq xok varơuq xưh xadrah kôt iaq. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Vii haay raay xatôôlh lôp đom 'ngưng kach. Atoh dro leq leh xatôôlh lôp đom apok đnooy, yôôych nưq laa dro xaleep, e hnoq 'yo jư hloay xăk xamơk. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Atoh haay trôôp ro maam muut moon ôô ahleh xôq khienq ni biq pheq tameng tyauq haay, yôôych haay jarooy dêq xăk ku ni. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Kung dayh 'yo kaluh poop tau e kơh nưlh kôt dik ji biq khiel kalh puh ranhuq, bơh muuyq poop tau jah raay ngưưr bơyh muuyq benh laayq thier de xôq truh aduq đơu pa xarôp ku manih laayq tau heq đinq. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Dang đanưq, kapiet laa muuyq đom phon de bơh laay pa ưưt akhwoak kaluh varơuq kôt. Dayh 'yo muuyq xau ôôlh de đaleq vuh jaq muuyq rơơk gôk kôt vlôh đaleq. <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Kapiet kung dang đaji ôôlh muuyq dêh araak lưp kaxay. Kapiet jah xôq măn katul kaluh đom dêq xăk xamơk ku haay, dơơp klơl 'yêq dêq xăk xamơk ji vuh jaq hloay tuôôy đơơy, đơu kadih ni yôôych biq vuh jaq 'laarq ôôlh karuk. <verse eid="JAS 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Tôôy kaluh paroh ôô gôk ji kaluh xêêp, kaluh paroh adool ji paroh tahli raay xakaq ik ji heq biq koot manih xakaq. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Bơh leh kơyq e hnoq ik jư poop kapiet, muuyq paroh xơk xơuq leh padơy dơơp loanq, viik nok đôk kaxêêt hlơơp. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Dii ni, haay ayuôôt laat Lôôk ji Vaq, kung dii ni, haay karoay axaap koot manih, laa koot manih heq jah pajêêk panưk tyauq long lơuq ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Apok ayuôôt laat ji apok karoay axaap đnooy vlôh xing kung muuyq poop huuy. Wơơy oh ay ku gô, kaluh varơuq đanưq be huq xalih vlôh. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Muuyq alook daak xing kung muuyq xaliap phơu be hnoq hoot vlôh daak jaleek ji hloay daak pahlăk, troq leh? <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Wơơy oh ay ku gô, gay pok puut leh hnoq ăm vlôh play ô-liu, long gay nho vlôh play pok puut, troq be? Daak phaak kung leh hnoq ăm vlôh daak jaleek.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Adro leq khôôt xet ji hlolh xet katul đom oh ay? Adro nưq pheq kahnoq vlôh kaluh varơuq dơơp ku ni vlôh xing đơơy riirh kaxay tamaq đom xuum klaak apôôt xăk ku varơuq khôôt xet. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Bơh atoh oh ay e varơuq 'yarơ tôq jaraq ji hmưch trôôch đom xuum ni, yôôych te pa ưưt akhwoak ji đnooy pa ôôh tachơơl dii varơuq dik. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Neq leh aalq laa varơuq khôôt xet kahri pôôt xing ataalh, bơh laa thưq thuôk dêh araak, danưng kooy, kamuuych. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Vii varơuq 'yarơ ji hmưch trôôch măn 'leq, yôôych varơuq xalôônq xalaaoq ji tôôy varơuq xơk xơuq măn đnư. <verse eid="JAS 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Wih hlê, varơuq khôôt xet xing ataalh adroyq dêq laa pa xarêh, atêq nưq laa xiaq trôôch tagu, hien kaxay, xuum klaak tameng tyauq, viik xuum biit angơuq ji kaluh raak play tolh taak, leh aklah xuum biit ravơq, leh dơơp bô. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Raak play ku varơuq hyioh jăk jah paraay đom tagu bơyh khơl manih dơơp varơuq tagu.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Kaluh đơơt takaay tayaat truh xing aduq leq ji kaluh varơuq tagoa vlôh xing 'leq katul đom oh ay? Be aalq ni vlôh xing kaluh hmưch trôôch ku oh ay, laa varơuq măn đong takaay tayaat katul kaluh xăk xamơk ku oh ay aleq? <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Oh ay hmưch trôôch đơu be e jah, oh ay păk kaxêêt manih. Oh ay biit trôôch, đơu leh hnoq jah ik, oh ay takaay tayaat ji tahmơt. Oh ay leh e vii oh ay leh vôôch. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Oh ay xiin đơu be nhonq jah vii oh ay xiin kach leh troq, xôq xa agưt ka kaluh hmưch trôôch ku oh ay. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Khơl adro tuut taak hơq! Oh ay leh xet đaneq varơuq dơơp 'wơyq dii dêh araak laa varơuq tachơơl dii Kơy Plêêk aleq? Ăm atoh, long kơyq xung laa 'wơyq dii dêh araak, yôôych adro nưq biq xôq muut ka aduq adro tachơơl ku Kơy Plêêk. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Long oh ay biit đaneq Rahlăp Vah đnooy hlo hloh: “Kơy Phool Hiel đơu Kadraq khienq riirh đom haay, Kơy nưq trôôch xiaq haay truh ajơ geen bơyq”? <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Lunưq, Kadraq kahniq ăm vanong plêêk kôt iaq, đơu Rahlăp Vah đnooy: “Kơy Plêêk tachơơl hlê adro katơơk galơh, bơh Kadraq kahniq vanong plêêk ka khơl apôôt xăk.” <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Vii anưq, dayh tameng tyauq Kơy Plêêk. Bơh dayh tachơơl hlê kamuuych, yôôch ni hnoq chuh xangưưy klơlh oh ay. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Dayh truh jeq Kơy Plêêk, ji Kadraq hnoq truh jeq oh ay. Khơl adro lôp kadrôôp, dayh dơơp xarêh ti oh ay, khơl leq vaarq xuum, dayh dơơp pa xarêh xuum oh ay. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Dayh hlu rơu, nhim ook ji tanguh alo! Dayh tađôôy apok xagiel ku oh ay jêêk apok nhim, ji tađôôy hlah hlaak vlôh varơuq hlu. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Dayh kadih apôôt xăk pôôt adroyq kangưưr Lôôk, yôôch Kadraq hnoq rôôk oh ay tok.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Wơơy oh ay, te đnooy xơuq mamuuyq. Adro đnooy xơuq oh ay long xưh xadrah oh ay ni laa đnooy xơuq ganuun ji xưh xadrah ganuun. Bơh atoh ay xưh xadrah ganuun yôôych ay leh aalq laa adro dơơp tyauq ganuun, đơu laa xưh xadrah. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Kơy kahniq ganuun ji xưh xadrah laa vơ muuyq, laa Kơy e qwuyen wơơt ji păk kaxêêt. Măn ay laa kơyq, ne adro xưh xadrah manih gah gih ay?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Juneq, dayh tameng ne, khơl adro đong đnooy đaneq: “Hngơy neng long hngơy dơh 'wot hnoq hooy truh theng hơq, yôôch hnoq dơơp varơuq aduq nưq muuyq xanưm, tabôôt tek ji karoh e.” <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Nưq khơl adro be xet ik varơuq hngơy dơh, đơơy riirh ku oh ay laa kajoq? Vii oh ay laa xa uh daak vlôh đom muuyq jơy yôôych biq rook hlơơp. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Tađôôy muut đnư, oh ay pheq đnooy: “Atoh Lôôk xung, yôôych 'wot hnoq riirh ji hnoq dơơp varơuq neq long varơuq hơq.” <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Bơh, oh ay juneq đong pa ưưt akhwoak đom katik katơơk galơh ku ni. Tôôy varơuq pa ưưt akhwoak đanưq laa xơk xơuq. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Ăm atoh, adro leq xet varơuq kaxay duh dơơp đơu laay leh dơơp, yôôych adro nưq e kadrôôp.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Măn tuôôy neq, dayh tabông truh đnen, khơl adro karoh kariêp hơq, dayh nhim ook ji pariau alo vii varơuq pơơl hwơơl ku khơl adro đong truh. <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Garuh anôôp khơl adro biq ra oom naat, măn qwuân aau khơl adro vlôh jêêk tuôông xa ka kamoor moq. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Vajang ji baak ku khơl adro biq hlah maau ji varơuq ka xaak ku kaluh nưq hnoq laa dưk xanưk tachơơl hlê khơl adro, ji kaluh ni hnoq xa luôôt xăk hlek khơl adro dang đaji ôôlh. Khơl adro heq chơt rahloot garuh anôôp ni đom kaluh hngơy lôôch dik. <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Dayh 'yo hơq, jêêt kông ku khơl adro dơơp xapo, nưq laa khơl thơq goch tol kaluh manay ruôngq ku khơl adro, jêêt nưq heq biq jư hlê aduq khơl adro, ni đong taayh pariau tok, ji kaluh apok nhim alo ku khơl thơq goch nưq heq truh pi tôôr Lôôk kaluh bing kuun. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Khơl adro heq riirh xa agưt ji vuul weel ataalh vari. Khơl adro heq pa heeq xuum ni ka hngơy păk kaxêêt. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Khơl adro heq rôp kadrôôp ji păk kaxêêt manih hyioh jăk, manih nưq leh tachơơl tangưưr hlê khơl adro.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Vii anưq, wơơy oh ay, dayh atuq xuum dong truh tuôôy Lôôk truh. 'Yo hơq, manih dơơp nôông takôô raak play quiq jaq xing vari, atuq xuum takôô ni dong truh tuôôy vari nhonq jah jit adroyq muua ji lôôch muua. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Oh ay kung pheq atuq xuum. Dayh dơơp ka kajưk xuum ni vii varơuq rama truh ku Lôôk heq jeq. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Oh ay lơơy, te ramôôl trek tachơơl hlê mamuuyq, xôq oh ay klơlh biq xưh xadrah. 'Yo hơq, Adro Xưh Xadrah đong dưk măn ka 'mok. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Wơơy oh ay, dayh dơơp atôôlh truh varơuq chiuq pơơl ji atuq xuum ku khơl kơy hlit, khơl manih taayh yal Lôôk padoh pato. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />'Yo ne, haay taayh khơl adro kajưk xuum laa e vanong. Oh ay heq tameng truh paraat chiuq uunq ku Joop, ji oh ay heq hloq muk đik ku Lôôk, vii Lôôk karoh xuum biit angơuq ji kaxay xuum.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Bơh adroyq dêq, wơơy oh ay ku gô, te paleek, kung te pahnho plêêk long pahnho vari long paq kê apok paleek leq đêh. Bơh, “e” yôôych pheq laa “e”, ji “leh” leh pheq laa “leh”, xôq oh ay leh klêh muut varơuq xưh xadrah.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Adro leq đom oh ay đong chiuq pơơl be? Adro nưq dayh xadrook apôôy. E kơyq hlah hlaak be? Adro nưq dayh ayuôôt laat. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Adro leq đom oh ay jiq jiêh be? Adro nưq dayh mơơy khơl kadraq lơơk đom tayuup vah truh ji đom yal ku Lôôk, oot pheq xadrook apôôy thêq ka ni, para jơu ka ni. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Apok xadrook apôôy ku xuum tuôq hnoq wơơt waak adro jiq jiêh ji Lôôk hnoq rôôk adro nưq kah. Atoh dro nưq e hnoq heq lôp kadrôôp, yôôych adro nưq hnoq jah ka'lăk. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Nưq, dayh xưng kadrôôp dii mamuuyq ji xadrook apôôy ka mamuuyq xôq oh ay e hnoq jah paxêêk yơh. Apok xadrook apôôy ku manih hyioh jăk tuôôy e da uh yôôych thier jah jêêk. <verse eid="JAS 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Ê-li laa muuyq koot manih chiuq xet ik hlah rơu i đaji haay, ji kơy xadrook apôôy dii varơuq dêq xuum xiin ka plêêk te jit, yôôych plêêk leh jit đom dêh tuôôt pe xanưm drơu xiêk. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Yôôch kơy laay xadrook apôôy, yôôych plêêk kahrôq jit, ji vari vlok raak play.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Wơơy oh ay ku gô, atoh manih leq đom oh ay hyaak tawaak klơlh varơuq dik, ji muuyq kơyq nưq jarooy manih nưq wiit xuq, <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />yôôych pheq xet đaneq kơyq wih ngưưr adro e kadrôôp vlôh klơlh trôôk hyaak hyul ku ni, manih nưq hnoq vook wơơt phool hiel adro nưq klơlh varơuq kaxêêt, ji hnoq katuh galôp thier 'ngưng kadrôôp maroh.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>